cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: eeg-report
abstract: 'HTML and PDF report of the scalp EEG workflows (Scalp EEG Interictal Biomarkers; Scalp EEG Seizure Detection
  & Monitoring): a recordings table, data quality from eeg-prep, and one section per linked step (seizure detection
  scores, spike rates and laterality, spectral biomarkers, sleep statistics, connectivity asymmetry) with the figures
  and captions each step wrote, warnings, licence notices and references, plus a tables folder. Rendered with Jinja
  and WeasyPrint. Research output, not a clinical interpretation.'
